      "mergedPostDetails": "Avatars with a flipped hip (the old \"IK Hack\") will not work with tracking being locked to the head. This will result in the Avatars chest being at weird angles, rotated all around and in general just looking broken.\nThis is a huge issue since a lot of Avatars still use a flipped hip and for those people the new IK wiht it being locked to the head will just not work. I hope you guys can implement a fix for this.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "flipped hip will not work with IK locked to head",
