      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While rig hacks are obviously bad and unnecessary, supporting this specific hack can be done by virtually moving hip bone origin to between the leg bones - this restores it to proper full length and provides better-looking IK to boot.\nBreaking most old avatars that still have this hack, and a bunch of new ones that have bad spine rigs that are similar enough (super short hip-spine distance/hip bone length) sounds rather suboptimal.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
